# 14. Known Limitations

Several limitations were identified during testing.

## Sensor Corrosion

The resistive soil moisture sensor may corrode after prolonged exposure to moisture.

## Limited Accuracy

DHT11 provides moderate accuracy compared to industrial sensors.

## No Water Flow Measurement

Actual water flow rate is not monitored.

## No Battery Backup

System requires continuous power supply.

## Single-Zone Irrigation

Current implementation supports only one irrigation zone.

